  eighth-ranges, so they are CELLS of the table below. Reproducing them to
  four decimals INCLUDING THE SE, from an independently written scorer over
  a per-eighth matrix, is what makes this §58's session rather than a second
  measurement of it. A 900k measurement, so UNDEFINED below that budget --
  the numbers still print so the plumbing stays visible.
